# QA-004: Resolve carbonate and bicarbonate with two alkalinity endpoints
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2CO3 0.0003mol
add v1 NaHCO3 0.0004mol
seal v1 1mL
titrate v1 HCl 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.3 max 100
inspect v1
titrate v1 HCl 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 4.5 max 150
inspect
